### Request

Invalidate successful `ANOMALY_DETECTION_CLOUD` batch-job schedule records for DFIN from **July 1, 2026 00:00 UTC inclusive**.

### Pre-check query

```javascript
const filter = {
  accountId: "QbXF1VIZTIC2-ueN1uTWHQ",
  batchJobType: "ANOMALY_DETECTION_CLOUD",
  startAt: { $gte: ISODate("2026-07-01T00:00:00.000Z") },
  $or: [
    { validRun: true },
    { validRun: { $exists: false } }
  ]
}

db.batchJobScheduledData.find(
  filter,
  { _id: 1, accountId: 1, batchJobType: 1, startAt: 1, endAt: 1, validRun: 1, comments: 1 }
).sort({ startAt: 1 })

db.batchJobScheduledData.countDocuments(filter)
```

Please share the matching record count before executing the update.

